Description:It is your first main phase. You control Grizzly Bears and Chandra Nalaar with 4 loyalty (+1: 1 damage to target player or planeswalker; -X: X damage to target creature). The opponent is at 2 life and controls an untapped Craw Wurm (6/4). Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-loyalty-to-zero | A loyalty cost may remove every loyalty counter; the planeswalker dies as a state-based action but its ability still resolves (CR 606.4, 704.5i, 113.7a): -4 kills the Craw Wurm and the Bears attack for 2; +1 deals only 1 and the Wurm blocks, and one loyalty ability per turn allows nothing more (CR 606.3)
